-- examples/checks/agg-sub-strata-ranks.rofl — for the stock evaluator: the
-- ranks rules/strata.rofl cannot give (telling a read from outside a
-- subsumptive relation's recursion from one inside needs a negation that
-- evaluator cannot order before it reads its table), so the program ranks
-- each outer reader of agg-sub-data.rofl and agg-sub-strata-check.rofl above
-- what it reads.
stratum(as_faster, 9).
stratum(as_fastest, 10).
stratum(assc_have, 9).
stratum(assc_extra, 9).
stratum(assc_missing, 10).
